  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In this project &apos;Extra activities for international responsible business conduct (RBC) agreement for Metals&#x2019;, Stichting CNV Internationaal, Federatie Nederlandse Vakbeweging, Stichting International Union for Conservation of Nature (IUCN) Nederlands Comit&#xe9;, Stichting Global March Against Child Labour contribute their knowledge and experience to support Dutch companies with implementing human resources (HR) due diligence during the implementation phase of RBC sector agreement for Metals.</narrative>
  </description>
